WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
move the left gripper toward the microphone.

2
00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.660
grasp the microphone with the left gripper.

3
00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:07.020
present the microphone for the other hand to grasp.

4
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:07.140
keep the left arm in its current position.

5
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:25.920
keep the left hand steady and wait for the other hand to complete its handover step.

6
00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.120
release the microphone to the other hand.

7
00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:52.087
withdraw the left hand from the transferred microphone.

